'''Derelict Ashe''' is an {{Uncommon}} item. It is used to craft items related to [[Blaze Slayer]], and is the primary ingredient of {{Item|Molten Powder}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Inferno Demonlord ===
'''Derelict Ashe''' is obtained by killing the {{MobSprite|Inferno Demonlord}} and is a token drop for [[Blaze Slayer]]. 

